>How do you engrave a wand, what do you write, and what does it do?  (Sorry 
>I'm asking lots of annoying questions, but I can't FTP the spoilers from 
>internet sites.)

Step 1. Engrave anything with your fingers. (E-asdf)
Step 2. Engrave something else with your wand (Ewjkl;) [where w is your wand]

Based on the message, try to figure out what the wand is.
eg: The bugs on the floor speed up: speed monster
    the bugs on the floor slow down: slow monster
    the bugs on the floor stop moving: sleep or death
    [some strange message] is engraved: polymorph
    ...
